  "description": "The mod_pagespeed engine for ASP.NET Core: drop-in middleware that improves Core Web Vitals without touching your app code, with critical CSS inlining, LCP preload, lazy loading, and on-demand WebP/AVIF transcoding on every HTML response. The C++23 engine runs in-process via P/Invoke. Single-package install with transitive native binaries for linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64, and win-x64.",
